        <rdfs:label>inputs (slot)</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>Per-input fingerprints for cache invalidation. Each entry records the IRI + dotted-field path of an ``aux_data`` reference plus the (mtime, size, sha256) of the underlying file at the time the artifact was produced. A downstream cache hit requires every fingerprint to match the current file state.</skos:definition>
