        <skos:definition>Exploration axes spanning the search space, keyed by the dotted parameter reference each axis sweeps (e.g. &quot;ReducedWongWang.w&quot; or &quot;FastLinearCoupling.G&quot;). Insertion order is preserved and defines the grid axis order. Each axis references an existing Parameter and supplies the Range to sweep; no new Parameter is created here.</skos:definition>
        <skos:inScheme rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo"/>
        <skos:notation>space</skos:notation>
    </owl:ObjectProperty>
    


