        <rdfs:label>FreeParameter</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>One degree of freedom in an OptimizationStage. References an existing Parameter by dotted scope (e.g. &quot;ReducedWongWang.w&quot; or &quot;FastLinearCoupling.G&quot;) and supplies optimization-specific metadata (heterogeneous, shape, bounds, initial value). No new Parameter is created here.</skos:definition>
