        <terms:description>Deco Balanced Exc-Inh model. It extends the Reduced Wong-Wang Exc-Inh (RWW_EI) dynamic mean-field model with an effective regional gain parameter M_i that scales both the excitatory and inhibitory input currents, capturing the dynamical consequences of regional heterogeneity in the brain&apos;s transcriptional landscape (Deco et al., 2021).</terms:description>
