        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/tvbo/Network"/>
        <terms:description>Group-average HCP connectome on the Glasser HCP-MMP1 atlas (360 cortical + 19 subcortical = 379 nodes). SC = average structural connectivity (streamline weights); FC = HCP1200 average resting-state functional connectivity. Node order is canonical L-cortical, R-cortical, L-subcortical, R-subcortical, Brainstem (identical to the rec-dTOR HCPMMP1 network). Node coordinates are fsLR den-32k midthickness parcel centroids (templateflow) for cortex and MNI152 2mm voxel centroids (Glasser dlabel Atlas_ROIs) for subcortex. Per-node HCP-MMP colours stored as the &apos;color&apos; parameter.</terms:description>
        <rdfs:label>tpl-MNI152NLin2009bAsym_cohort-HCPYA_rec-avgMatrix_atlas-HCPMMP1_desc-SCFC_relmat</rdfs:label>
